00:08:37.783 --> 00:08:39.318
there and over estimated

00:08:39.318 --> 00:08:42.622
200 including Wagner Group in 2018.

00:08:42.855 --> 00:08:45.358
So there is a swirl of different

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.592
activities now.

00:08:46.592 --> 00:08:50.029
The key point with the Iranian proxies

00:08:50.196 --> 00:08:52.031
is whether they really have a swath

00:08:52.031 --> 00:08:54.133
that goes through Syria's

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:55.935
sort of wild west.

00:08:55.935 --> 00:08:57.203
South

00:08:58.004 --> 00:09:00.039
is also risks

00:09:00.473 --> 00:09:02.608
and it makes the Russians crazy

00:09:02.942 --> 00:09:05.411
are getting the Israelis more involved.

00:09:05.411 --> 00:09:07.213
And the Israelis have done

00:09:07.213 --> 00:09:09.048
a number of these type of strikes

00:09:09.048 --> 00:09:11.117
that we are doing now.

00:09:11.117 --> 00:09:13.553
In against the Syrians and the Iranians

00:09:13.786 --> 00:09:14.520
as well.

00:09:14.520 --> 00:09:17.223
It's a complete mix of groups,

00:09:17.623 --> 00:09:20.993
proxies, countries up in the north east.

